[l_english.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_SNIPER]
Arcane Enchanted Heavy Sniper (Witchcraft)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_MAGICAL_RANGED_SNIPER_desc]
So... (sweat) I guess magic really does enhance the power of firearms.
§g“In some crime shows, criminals are often exposed because they use uncommon weapons on the market. I think the same goes for these magical firearms.”§!

